{"id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","title":"Homotopy","display":"df-homotopy — Homotopy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homotopy","aliases":["58-df-homotopy","Homotopy"],"display":"df-homotopy — Homotopy","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homotopy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homotopy</span><span>Homotopy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homotopy — Homotopy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f,g,H\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f,g,H\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\\in V\">\\(I=[0,1]\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I=\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\">\\(\\tau_I=\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NullHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{NullHomotopic}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Contractible}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Contractible}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times I=\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle:x\\in X\\land t\\in I\\}\">\\(X\\times I=\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle:x\\in X\\land t\\in I\\}\\)</span> 使用有序对；其拓扑由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\\)</span> 给出，不与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in2}X_i\">\\(\\prod_{i\\in2}X_i\\)</span> 的函数载体作字面等同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,g,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land f,g\\in Y^X\\land\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=f(x)\\land H(\\langle x,1\\rangle)=g(x))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,g,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land f,g\\in Y^X\\land\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I),Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=f(x)\\land H(\\langle x,1\\rangle)=g(x))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NullHomotopic}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in Y\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\n(h=\\{\\langle x,c\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,h,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NullHomotopic}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in Y\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\n(h=\\{\\langle x,c\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,h,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}contractible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Contractible}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\exists c\\in X\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\n(h=\\{\\langle x,c\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},h,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}contractible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Contractible}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\exists c\\in X\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\n(h=\\{\\langle x,c\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\},h,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homotopy: continuous deformation of one map to another</li>\n<li>Relative homotopy: fixed on subspace</li>\n<li>Homotopy equivalence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\simeq Y \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\exists f: X \\to Y, g: Y \\to X\">\\(X \\simeq Y \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\exists f: X \\to Y, g: Y \\to X\\)</span> s.t. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf \\simeq \\mathrm{id}, fg \\simeq \\mathrm{id}\">\\(gf \\simeq \\mathrm{id}, fg \\simeq \\mathrm{id}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Fundamental group: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(X) = [S^1, X]\">\\(\\pi_1(X) = [S^1, X]\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"